<ArticleLayout
  title="GarageCloud vs Motasoft | Comparison"
  description="How GarageCloud compares to Motasoft's Virtual Garage Manager: pricing and credit-based costs. Motasoft charges per-lookup credits on top of its base fee; GarageCloud's plans are flat monthly fees."
  eyebrow="Comparison"
  breadcrumbLabel="GarageCloud vs Motasoft"
